---
const GITHUB_URL = "https://github.com/FLBracco";
const EMAIL = "braccof.0601@gmail.com";
const year = new Date().getFullYear();
---

<footer id="contacto" class="border-t border-border">
	<div class="mx-auto max-w-5xl px-6 py-16">
		<h2 class="text-2xl font-extrabold tracking-tight sm:text-3xl">¿Hablamos?</h2>
		<p class="mt-3 max-w-md text-muted">
			Si tenés un proyecto en mente o querés charlar sobre alguno de los repos, escribime.
		</p>
		<div class="mt-8 flex flex-wrap gap-4">
			<a
				href={`mailto:${EMAIL}`}
				class="inline-flex items-center gap-2 border border-accent bg-accent px-5 py-2.5 text-sm font-semibold text-accent-fg transition-opacity duration-150 ease-out hover:opacity-90"
			>
				{EMAIL}
			</a>
			<a
				href={GITHUB_URL}
				target="_blank"
				rel="noopener noreferrer"
				class="inline-flex items-center gap-2 border border-border px-5 py-2.5 text-sm font-semibold text-fg transition-colors duration-150 ease-out hover:border-accent hover:text-accent"
			>
				GitHub
			</a>
		</div>
		<p class="mt-16 text-xs text-muted">© {year} Fabricio Bracco</p>
	</div>
</footer>
